OL,3,GNEWSAMan attempts to run 100 miles
OL,4,Aaround a roundabout
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllan raised more than #4,300 for
OL,7,Fcharity Gym Possible in Gateshead,
OL,8,Fwhich has specialist staff and
OL,9,Fequipment designed for people with
OL,10,Fdisabilities.
